===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|mustard}}, from {{der|en|fro|moustarde}} (French: {{m|fr|moutarde}}), from {{m|fro|moust||must}}, from {{der|en|la|mustum}}. Compare {{cog|stq|Muster|t=mustard}}, {{cog|nl|mosterd|t=mustard}}, {{cog|nds-de|Musterd|t=mustard}}, {{cog|is|mustarður|t=mustard}}. Displaced {{noncog|enm|senep}}, from {{noncog|ang|senep}}, from {{noncog|la|sināpi|t=mustard}}. {{doublet|en|mostarda}}.

