===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s}}

# A plant of certain species of the genus ''[[Brassica]]'', or of related genera (especially ''[[Sinapis alba]]'', in the family [[Brassicaceae]], with yellow [[flower]]s, and linear [[seed]] [[pod]]s).
# Powder or paste made from seeds of the mustard plant, and used as a [[condiment]] or a [[spice]].
#: {{ux|en|When the waitress brought the food, I asked whether she had any Dijon '''mustard'''.}}
# The leaves of the mustard plant, used as a [[salad]].
#: {{ux|en|'''Mustard''' and cress sandwiches.}}
# Dark [[yellow]] [[color|colour]], the colour of mustard.
#: {{color panel|e6d200}}
# One of a family of [[vesicant]]s containing one or more 2-chloroethyl (C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>4</sub>Cl) groups, commonly used in [[chemical warfare]] and [[cancer]] [[chemotherapy]].
# The [[tomalley]] of a [[crab]], which resembles the condiment.

